=== base ===
# Window Maintenance Agreement

This Agreement is made between Clearview Access Ltd (the "Contractor") and Halberd Property Management Ltd (the "Manager").

## 4. Works
4.1 The Contractor shall clean all external windows every eight weeks.
4.2 The Contractor shall complete each visit between 7am and 4pm.
4.3 The Contractor shall photograph each elevation after cleaning.
=== amendment ===
# Letter Amendment

From Halberd Property Management Ltd (the "Manager") to Clearview Access Ltd (the "Contractor"), dated 2 August 2027.

Dear Sirs,

We write further to our recent meeting. We agree that clause 4.2 will be replaced with the following: "The Contractor shall complete each visit between 9am and 6pm."

We also agree that clause 4.3 will no longer apply.

Please countersign this letter to confirm your agreement.
